&_nc_oc=Adorl4tWA265aD5ltOz1SY4lw4SPgEkXu6SKxsk94kBH-cDy2Ea6SSm-PODdt_PkxuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0PaAhZb5gonBoTXQVuMkcNhvA_2ktw_PxJUnigF3BIng&oe=69DA2D7E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rKSD5eqMwR4Q7kNvwHn3E7C&_nc_oc=AdpAnJpam9gE9jE7RsXSWFwW6EplWqgmYWz4v2pz4Dv7vCM6KA4GpytVp6C0spIuOnw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2GuRweArQWDV2Dy9qdBFTqPxiNEeYeHMqvBl5S64T-fg&oe=69DA3E7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UhYX-HuWDlsQ7kNvwHpNYIW&_nc_oc=AdrkXcIF_m5lWdhR9Tf0SHVkOEGiGCwUrdwUOhJVogbdtgN8Fa7fTn_T_HfdDXNwWF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1itpvBz-THnl7Y8HGED8_iyam41Y-FbQKDo_j5ROGnXQ&oe=69DA5D07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YDEjIYDXPXYQ7kNvwH7cwF1&_nc_oc=AdoN4Y163OAf2F_Vnwo-1mMUkTqYRKaIS217gripgeryai9rA29Kp8LPDJJ87RkNjmw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1HMWSULAA7lJo6ROz343FarYEIhPAUWygmIBOT1YfFDw&oe=69DA48D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RntzeKoFZUAQ7kNvwH-Dg8V&_nc_oc=AdoTGQ7M3Epe0H6HbPW3X2mpSEQNs7K0RIcp1vTedODcuhyYoNHB-9oR2u8UltlKEDU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2DBXVLd6JMjqx67w2l2469gIGXaUc4iq-nC53HFLjfjA&oe=69DA5564"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.